DifferentialGeometry/External/DeGiorgi/README.md:5:This repository formalizes the De Giorgi/Moser weak-solution theory for uniformly elliptic divergence-form equations with general bounded measurable uniformly elliptic coefficients, proving local boundedness, weak Harnack, Harnack, and Hölder regularity. The development is fully formalized, sorry-free, and axiom-free beyond Lean and Mathlib, and is organized around the namespace `DeGiorgi`.
